    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a pretty intense stance. I see you've already framed it as a battle against monopolies. To make the podcast balanced, I need the other side too. What are the actual legal and technical arguments tech companies use to defend their position on IP and repair restrictions? Try to present them as seriously as you did the repair side.",
